	linkml:description "Per 2021 ISDA Definitions, Section 4.6.1 Day Count Fraction, paragraph (viii), per 2006 ISDA Definitions, Section 4.16. Day Count Fraction, paragraph (h). Note the algorithm for this day count fraction under the 2006 ISDA Definitions is designed to yield the same results in practice as the version of the 30E/360 day count fraction defined in the 2000 ISDA Definitions. See Introduction to the 2006 ISDA Definitions for further information relating to this change." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/30E/360> skos:altLabel "_30E_360" ;
