<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Borrower> linkml:description "The entity that receives cash or assets from a lender with the expectation that cash or assets will be returned at a future agreed date and price." , "The party that borrows securities under stock lending arrangements." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Both> linkml:description "Both parties with joined rights to be a calculation agent." , "For a return on day T, the observed prices on both T and T-1 must be in range" , "Specifies that both the option buyer and option seller has the right to exercise." , "The average price is used to derive both the strike and the expiration price." .
