<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CalculationAgentIndependent> linkml:description "Specifies the party responsible for performing calculation agent duties as defined in the applicable product definition." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CalculationAgentMandatoryEarlyTermination> linkml:description "Specifies the party responsible for performing calculation agent duties associated with an mandatory early termination." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CalculationAgentOptionalEarlyTermination> linkml:description "Specifies the party responsible for performing calculation agent duties associated with an optional early termination." .
