<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Closing> linkml:description "Denotes a value as the Closing price reported in or by the relevant Price Source as specified in the relevant Confirmation." , "The close of trading on a day would be considered for valuation." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ClosingPrice> linkml:description "Official Closing Price." , "The last price anyone paid for a share of a product during the business hours of the exchange where the product is traded on a business day." .
