	linkml:description "Class to specify a mechanism for a quantity to be set as a multiplier to another (reference) quantity, based on a price observation. At the moment this class only supports FX or Equity-linked notional and re-uses existing building blocks for those 2 cases, until such time when component can be made more generic. This captures the case of resetting cross-currency swaps and resetting equity swaps." ;
