<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/amount> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	linkml:description "Current value of the outstanding contract" , "Specifies the monetary value of the Threshold or the Minimum Transfer Amount (MTA) applicable to collateral transfer obligations." , "Specifies the notional or collateral Independent Amount." , "The Minimum Transfer Amount (MTA) applicable to the Rating." , "The amount value applicable to the Threshold." , "The elective amount when expressed as a currency amount. The associated PartyElectiveAmount_amount data rule enforces that the currency amount is actually greater than 0." , "The maximum amount to which the difference between the calculations by the valuation agent and disputing party can be split, where Split the Difference is elected." , "The monetary quantity in currency units." ;
