	linkml:description "A code identifying a business day calendar location. A business day calendar location is drawn from the list identified by the business day calendar location enumeration." , "A code identifying one or several business day calendar location(s). The set of business day calendar locations are specified by the business day calendar location enumeration which is maintained by the FpML standard." , "Inclusion of this business center element implies that Greenwich Mean Time in Section 3.3 of the 2003 ISDA Credit Derivatives Definitions is replaced by the local time of the city indicated by the businessCenter element value." , "Specifies the business center for adjustment of calculation period." , "Specifies the location where the exercise must be reported, e.g. where the exercise notice receiver is based." , "The Calculation Date Location when specified as a business center which corresponds to the FpML list of business centers or can be mapped to it." ;
