<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/fxHaircutCurrency> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	linkml:description "The reference currency for the purpose of specifying the FX Haircut relating to a posting obligation, as being either the Termination Currency or an FX Designated Currency." ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FxHaircutCurrency> .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/fxHaircutCurrency__fxDesignatedCurrency> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/cdm_legaldocumentation_csa"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:prefLabel "fxDesignatedCurrency" ;
	linkml:annotations _:c14n2060 ;
	linkml:description "When specified, the reference currency for the purpose of specifying the FX Haircut relating to a posting obligation. The list of valid currencies is not presently positioned as an enumeration as part of the CDM because that scope is limited to the values specified by ISDA and FpML. As a result, implementers have to make reference to the relevant standard, such as the ISO 4217 standard for currency codes." ;
	linkml:domain_of <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FxHaircutCurrency> ;
	linkml:owner <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FxHaircutCurrency> ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/string> ;
	linkml:slot_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/fxDesignatedCurrency"^^xsd:anyURI .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/fxHaircutCurrency__isTerminationCurrency> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/cdm_legaldocumentation_csa"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:prefLabel "isTerminationCurrency" ;
	linkml:description "The reference currency for the purpose of specifying the FX Haircut relating to a posting obligation is the Termination Currency when the Boolean value is set to True." ;
	linkml:domain_of <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FxHaircutCurrency> ;
	linkml:owner <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/FxHaircutCurrency> ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/boolean> ;
	linkml:required true ;
	linkml:slot_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/isTerminationCurrency"^^xsd:anyURI .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/fxHaircutPercentage> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	linkml:description "FX Haircut Percentage means, for any item of Eligible Collateral (IM), the percentage specified in accordance with Paragraph 13." , "Specifies an FX haircut applied to a specific asset which is agreed between the parties (for example, if pledgor eligible collateral is not denominated in the termination currency or under other specified cases in collateral support documents both for initial margin and variation margin).The percentage value is expressed as the discount haircut to the value of the collateral- as an example an 8% FX haircut would be expressed as 0.08." ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/decimal> .
