<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/incurredRecoveryApplicable> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	linkml:description "Outstanding Swap Notional Amount is defined at any time on any day, as the greater of: (a) Zero; If Incurred Recovery Amount Applicable: (b) The Original Swap Notional Amount minus the sum of all Incurred Loss Amounts and all Incurred Recovery Amounts (if any) determined under this Confirmation at or prior to such time.Incurred Recovery Amount not populated: (b) The Original Swap Notional Amount minus the sum of all Incurred Loss Amounts determined under this Confirmation at or prior to such time." ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/boolean> .
