	linkml:description "The SIMM Calculation Currency (also known as SIMM Reporting Currency) means the Base Currency when True. It means a different currency when False. In that latter case, the SIMM Calculation Currency is specified as part of the currency attribute." ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/boolean> ;
