<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/marketFixedRate> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	linkml:description "An optional element that only has meaning in a credit index trade. This element contains the credit spread ('fair value') at which the trade was executed. Unlike the fixedRate of an index, the marketFixedRate varies over the life of the index depending on market conditions. The marketFixedRate is the price of the index as quoted by trading desks." ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/decimal> .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/marketPrice> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
