<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/optionPayout__optionType> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/cdm_product_template"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:prefLabel "optionType" ;
	linkml:description "The type of option transaction. From a usage standpoint, put/call is the default option type, while payer/receiver indicator is used for options on index credit default swaps, consistently with the industry practice. Straddle is used for the case of straddle strategy, that combine a call and a put with the same strike." ;
