<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/party> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	linkml:annotations _:c14n2912 , _:c14n2913 ;
	linkml:description "Defines all parties involved for the list of inventory records in this set of inventory. For example, when used to describe securities lending availability, this could hold the sender of the availability, the intended recipient, the beneficial owner(s), the lender (which may differ from the sender as the lender may have the same piece of availability going through multiple agents), an agent or a venue." , "Identification of the represented party." , "Identifies the Party making the election." , "Identifies the party making the election." , "Reference to the Party who is approving/rejecting this workflow step" , "Represents the parties to the margin call. The cardinality is optional to address the case where both parties of the event are specified and a third party if applicable." , "Represents the parties to the trade. The cardinality is optional to address the case where the trade is defined within a BusinessEvent data type, in which case the party is specified in BusinessEvent." , "Specification of which party calculating the value of collateral to be delivered or returned." , "Specifies the party providing the security." , "Specifies the party to the umbrella agreement" , "Specifies the underlying parties to the agreement that either act as legal parties to the agreement or represent legal constructs that are managed by a party to the agreement but do not represent a Legal Entity as of themselves." , "Specifies whether the debt security is redeemed at the election of the Issuer/Holder." , "The elective party to which the Security Interest for Obligations is applicable." , "The elective party." , "The parties associated with the specification." , "The parties involved in the position, including the Clearing Organization." , "The party acting as the Single Posting Party." , "The party for which the Automatic Early Termination provisions are being specified." , "The party for which the provisions are being specified." , "The party for which the regime terms are being specified when acting as collateral taker." , "The party that is acting as the Pledgor/Obligor/Chargor/Security Provider." , "The party that the additional obligations apply to." , "The party to which the election applies." , "The party to which the elections apply." , "The party to which the minimum transfer amount applies." , "The party to which the threshold applies." , "The party which is specified as Calculation Agent for Initial Margin." , "The party which the SIMM Calculation Currency qualification applies to." , "The party with the obligation to pay dividends, coupons, or other payouts to the asset holder." , "The specification of the event parties. This attribute is optional, as not applicable to certain events (e.g. most of the observations)." , "The specified party." , "To aggregate based on a selection of party(ies) / legal entity(ies)." ;
	linkml:maximum_cardinality 2 ;
	linkml:minimum_cardinality 2 ;
	linkml:multivalued true ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CalculationValuationAgentPartyEnum> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/CounterpartyRoleEnum> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Party> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/RedemptionPartyEnum> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/UmbrellaAgreementParty> ;
	linkml:required true ;
	linkml:value_presence "ABSENT" , "PRESENT" .
