	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/Reset> .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/resetInstruction> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	linkml:description "Data needed to record the Reset Instruction." , "Defines the reset value or fixing value produced in cashflow calculations, during the life-cycle of a financial instrument. The reset process defined in Create_Reset function joins product definition details with observations to compute the reset value." ;
