	skos:prefLabel "breakdown" ;
	linkml:description "Each split breakdown specifies the set of primitive instructions to be applied to a single branch of that split. N split breakdowns result in N output trades, which include the original trade. Instructions for how to handle the original trade (e.g. if it must be closed) must be specified in one of the breakdowns." ;
	linkml:domain_of <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SplitInstruction> ;
