<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/trade__tradeIdentifier> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/cdm_event_common"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:prefLabel "tradeIdentifier" ;
	linkml:description "Represents the identifier(s) that uniquely identify a trade for an identity issuer. A trade can include multiple identifiers, for example a trade that is reportable to both the CFTC and ESMA, and then has an associated USI (Unique Swap Identifier) UTI (Unique Trade Identifier)." ;
