	skos:prefLabel "referenceBanks" ;
	linkml:description "A container for a set of reference institutions that may be called upon to provide rate quotations as part of the method to determine the applicable cash settlement amount. If institutions are not specified, it is assumed that reference institutions will be agreed between the parties on the exercise date, or in the case of swap transaction to which mandatory early termination is applicable, the cash settlement valuation date." ;
	linkml:domain_of <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ValuationSource> ;
